<title>HONG KONG: PT Cheil Samsung Indonesia seeks loan underwriters.</title>
<headline>PT Cheil Samsung Indonesia seeks loan underwriters.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>KDB Asia said it was inviting banks to join as arrangers or underwriters for a US$95 million term loan facility for PT Cheil Samsung Indonesia.</p>
<p>The loan carried a maturity of five years and has a put option in year three, it said.</p>
<p>The facility would be guaranteed by Cheil Jedang Corporation, KDB Asia said.</p>
<p>Proceeds would be used for general working capital, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
